msgid "=== \"Pre-built image (recommended)\""
msgstr "=== \"预构建镜像（推荐）\""

msgid "## 4.1 Use a Pre-built vLLM Ascend Image {: #pre-built-image }"
msgstr "## 4.1 使用预构建 vLLM Ascend 镜像 {: #pre-built-image }"

msgid ""
"If your goal is to obtain a reproducible environment as quickly as possible,"
" use a pre-built image."
msgstr "如果目标是最快得到可复现环境，优先使用预构建镜像。"

msgid "The host only needs:"
msgstr "Host 只需要："

msgid ""
"- a working Ascend driver/firmware;\n"
"    - Docker."
msgstr ""
"- 正常工作的 Ascend driver/firmware；\n"
"    - Docker。"

msgid ""
"The image provides the CANN userspace, PyTorch/TorchNPU, vLLM, and vLLM "
"Ascend."
msgstr "CANN userspace、PyTorch/TorchNPU、vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend 都由镜像提供。"

msgid "### 4.1.1 Select an Image {: #pre-built-image-matrix }"
msgstr "### 4.1.1 选择镜像 {: #pre-built-image-matrix }"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/image_matrix.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/image_matrix.inc.md\" %}"

msgid ""
"Use this matrix during installation to select an image by hardware and "
"container operating system. In the Quickstart, use the complete image name "
"and container command provided for the corresponding hardware path."
msgstr ""
"这张矩阵用于在安装阶段按硬件和容器操作系统选择镜像。进入 Quickstart 后，\n"
"    直接使用对应硬件路径中已经写好的完整镜像名称和容器命令。"

msgid "### 4.1.2 Pull the Image {: #pre-built-image-pull }"
msgstr "### 4.1.2 拉取镜像 {: #pre-built-image-pull }"

msgid ""
"Select an `IMAGE` from the table above that matches your hardware and "
"container operating system."
msgstr "从上表选择与你的硬件和容器操作系统匹配的 `IMAGE`。"

msgid ""
"Device mappings and host mounts vary substantially between hardware "
"products, especially for Atlas A3 and Atlas 200I Pro."
msgstr ""
"不同硬件的 device mapping 和 Host mount 差异较大，尤其是 Atlas A3 和\n"
"        Atlas 200I Pro。"

msgid ""
"To avoid maintaining duplicate container commands in Installation and the "
"Quickstart, this page covers only: **host ready + image ready**."
msgstr ""
"为避免 Installation 与 Quickstart 重复维护两套容器命令，本页只负责：\n"
"        **Host ready + 镜像 ready**。"

msgid ""
"After proceeding to [Quickstart > 3. Select Hardware and "
"Run](quick_start.md#quickstart-hardware), copy the complete `docker run` "
"command for your actual hardware and continue to your first inference."
msgstr ""
"进入 [Quickstart > 3. 选择硬件并运行](quick_start.md#quickstart-hardware) 后，\n"
"        根据实际硬件复制对应的完整 `docker run` 命令，并继续第一次推理。"

msgid "??? \"Build a vLLM Ascend image from a Dockerfile\""
msgstr "??? \"从 Dockerfile 构建 vLLM Ascend 镜像\""

msgid "To modify the image contents or package local code, build from source:"
msgstr "当你需要修改镜像内容或打包本地代码时，可以从源码构建："

msgid ""
"The default `Dockerfile` targets Atlas A2. For other hardware, use the "
"corresponding Dockerfile in the repository, such as an A3, 310P image "
"variant, or 950-series file."
msgstr ""
"默认 `Dockerfile` 面向 Atlas A2。其他硬件使用仓库中对应的 Dockerfile，\n"
"        例如 A3、310P image variant 或 950 系列文件。"

msgid "For example:"
msgstr "例如："

msgid "### 4.1.3 Completion Criteria {: #pre-built-image-complete }"
msgstr "### 4.1.3 完成标准 {: #pre-built-image-complete }"

msgid ""
"The pre-built image installation path is complete when `docker image inspect"
" \"$IMAGE\"` succeeds and prints `Image ready`. Next, proceed to the "
"[Quickstart](quick_start.md) and run your first inference with the complete "
"container command for your hardware."
msgstr ""
"`docker image inspect \"$IMAGE\"` 成功并输出 `Image ready` 后，\n"
"    预构建镜像安装路径完成。下一步进入 [Quickstart](quick_start.md)，\n"
"    使用对应硬件的完整容器命令运行第一次推理。"

msgid "When you see:"
msgstr "看到："

msgid ""
"!!! note \"Why doesn't Installation maintain every docker run command "
"here?\""
msgstr "!!! note \"为什么 Installation 不在这里维护所有 docker run 命令？\""

msgid "This indicates that the image is ready."
msgstr "即表示镜像已经准备好。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："
